    "body": "Fixed. `pi.setSessionName()` now goes through `AgentSession.setSessionName()`, which emits a session metadata change event. Interactive mode listens for that event and refreshes the terminal title immediately, matching `/name` behavior.\n\nAdded regression coverage for direct `AgentSession.setSessionName()` and extension-driven `pi.setSessionName()` calls.\n\nValidation:\n- `npx tsx ../../node_modules/vitest/dist/cli.js --run test/suite/regressions/3686-session-name-event.test.ts`\n- `npm run check`\n",
